# A global excludes file (core.excludesFile) ignores "main", "README.md" and "gradlew.bat",
# which silently drops src/main/, this file and the Windows wrapper. Repo rules win over the
# global file, so re-include them. Remove these if that global config is ever fixed.
!src/main/
!README.md
!gradlew.bat
